    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 14th level, when you are forced to make a <strong>saving throw</strong> caused by an effect you can see, you can add a bonus equal to your <strong>Charisma modifier</strong> to the roll.</p><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> per <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</p><hr /><h3>Unshakeable Poise (17th Level)</h3><p>At 17th level, you gain <strong>1 additional use</strong> of this feature per Long Rest.</p>"
